E19_CHECK {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.fullBFGS_convergence","strict_definitional_type_check":true,"signature":"∀ {a b : ℝ → ℝ},\n  ContDiff ℝ 2 a →\n    ContDiff ℝ 2 b →\n      ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ a →\n        ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ b →\n          ∀ {p q u : ℝ},\n            0 < p →\n              0 < q →\n                (∀ (t : ℝ),\n                    BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u ≤\n                      BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q t) →\n                  (∀ (t : ℝ),\n                      BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q t =\n                          BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u →\n                        t = u) →\n                    (∀ (t : ℝ), t ≠ u → 0 < deriv (deriv a) t) →\n                      (∀ (t : ℝ), t ≠ u → 0 < deriv (deriv b) t) →\n                        ∀\n                          (R :\n                            BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2\n                              (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.objective a b p q)),\n                          Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.objective a b p q (R.x k))\n                              Filter.atTop (𝓝 (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u)) ∧\n                            Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (𝓝 (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.optimizer a b p q u))","contract":"EJob13.Contract02","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
